Package: cvr
Title: Polygonal Coverage Operations via GEOS
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael", "Sumner", email = "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Bindings to the GEOS coverage API: topology-preserving
    simplification of polygonal coverages, coverage validation, and
    coverage union. These are set-level operators that consume a whole
    vector of polygons as one coverage and return a result parallel to
    it, so shared edges are simplified once and stay edge-matched in
    both neighbours. Geometry is exchanged as well-known binary, so any
    'wk' compatible vector is accepted and returned. Requires GEOS
    3.12.0 or later.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: wk
SystemRequirements: GEOS (>= 3.12.0)
